# docs/ is local scratch, except the README's screenshots: those are part of the
documentation and the README embeds them by path. A parent directory cannot be
re-included through a child, so the directory itself is un-ignored first.
docs
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/screenshots/

# Architecture decisions are documentation, like the screenshots, and are
# referenced from the README. Un-ignored the same way, so a decision does not
# exist only inside the session that made it.
!docs/adr/

# Model recordings are local evidence, not source. A recording holds the raw
# model response, which quotes the code that was reviewed, so it is produced per
# machine and never committed. `CODERADAR_REPLAY_DIR` moves it elsewhere.
.coderadar/
